  "prayer_fragments": [
    {
      "unit": "morning_before_prayer",
      "language": "en",
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "fragment_index": 0,
      "text": "Hear my prayer, O Lord, listen to my entreaty, at my tears do not be silent.",
      "reference_scan": "s43",
      "reference_readings_sha256": "ec12d97226b9adf43efea9e010be1cbf1ac9559095537d959b7760fdfb5c4f6f"
    },
    {
      "unit": "morning_before_prayer",
      "language": "en",
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "fragment_index": 0,
      "text": "Hear, O Lord, and be gracious to me, O Lord, be my aid.",
      "reference_scan": "s43",
      "reference_readings_sha256": "ec12d97226b9adf43efea9e010be1cbf1ac9559095537d959b7760fdfb5c4f6f"
    },
    {
      "unit": "morning_before_prayer",
      "language": "en",
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "fragment_index": 0,
      "text": "Song of the ascents by David: I am glad when they say to me: Let us go into the House of the Lord.",
      "reference_scan": "s43",
      "reference_readings_sha256": "ec12d97226b9adf43efea9e010be1cbf1ac9559095537d959b7760fdfb5c4f6f"
    },
    {
      "unit": "morning_before_prayer",
      "language": "en",
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "fragment_index": 0,
      "text": "I rejoice at Thy word as one who has found abundant booty.",
      "reference_scan": "s43",
      "reference_readings_sha256": "ec12d97226b9adf43efea9e010be1cbf1ac9559095537d959b7760fdfb5c4f6f"
    },
    {
      "unit": "morning_before_prayer",
      "language": "en",
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "fragment_index": 0,
      "text": "Lister to the sound of my cry, my King and my God, for to Thee do I pray.",
      "reference_scan": "s43",
      "reference_readings_sha256": "ec12d97226b9adf43efea9e010be1cbf1ac9559095537d959b7760fdfb5c4f6f"
    },
    {
      "unit": "morning_before_prayer",
      "language": "en",
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "fragment_index": 0,
      "text": "O Lord, in the morning listen to my voice, in the morning I address Thee and I have hope.",
      "reference_scan": "s43",
      "reference_readings_sha256": "ec12d97226b9adf43efea9e010be1cbf1ac9559095537d959b7760fdfb5c4f6f"
    },
    {
      "unit": "morning_before_prayer",
      "language": "en",
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "fragment_index": 0,
      "text": "I called to Thee for Thou dost respond to me. O God, incline Thine ear to me, hear my word.",
      "reference_scan": "s43",
      "reference_readings_sha256": "ec12d97226b9adf43efea9e010be1cbf1ac9559095537d959b7760fdfb5c4f6f"
    },
    {
      "unit": "morning_before_prayer",
      "language": "en",
      "paragraph_index": 15,
      "fragment_index": 0,
      "text": "My foot has stood on level ground. In assemblies will I praise the Lord.",
      "reference_scan": "s43",
      "reference_readings_sha256": "ec12d97226b9adf43efea9e010be1cbf1ac9559095537d959b7760fdfb5c4f6f"
    },
    {
      "unit": "yigdal",
      "language": "en",
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "fragment_index": 0,
      "text": "Exalted is the living God and praised. He exists and timeless is His existence.",
      "reference_scan": "s43",
      "reference_readings_sha256": "ec12d97226b9adf43efea9e010be1cbf1ac9559095537d959b7760fdfb5c4f6f"
    },
    {
      "unit": "yigdal",
      "language": "en",
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "fragment_index": 0,
      "text": "He is unique and there is nought unique like His uniqueness. He is hidden and infinite too is His unity.",
      "reference_scan": "s43",
      "reference_readings_sha256": "ec12d97226b9adf43efea9e010be1cbf1ac9559095537d959b7760fdfb5c4f6f"
    },
    {
      "unit": "yigdal",
      "language": "en",
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "fragment_index": 0,
      "text": "He has not the shape of a body nor is He a body. We cannot estimate His sanctity.",
      "reference_scan": "s43",
      "reference_readings_sha256": "ec12d97226b9adf43efea9e010be1cbf1ac9559095537d959b7760fdfb5c4f6f"
    },
    {
      "unit": "yigdal",
      "language": "en",
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "fragment_index": 0,
      "text": "He was there before anything that was created; He is the first and there was no beginning to His beginning.",
      "reference_scan": "s43",
      "reference_readings_sha256": "ec12d97226b9adf43efea9e010be1cbf1ac9559095537d959b7760fdfb5c4f6f"
    },
    {
      "unit": "yigdal",
      "language": "en",
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "fragment_index": 0,
      "text": "Behold He is the Master of the world and every creature indicates His grandeur and His rule.",
      "reference_scan": "s43",
      "reference_readings_sha256": "ec12d97226b9adf43efea9e010be1cbf1ac9559095537d959b7760fdfb5c4f6f"
    },
    {
      "unit": "yigdal",
      "language": "en",
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "fragment_index": 0,
      "text": "The wealth of His prophecy did He bestow upon men of His possession and His glory.",
      "reference_scan": "s43",
      "reference_readings_sha256": "ec12d97226b9adf43efea9e010be1cbf1ac9559095537d959b7760fdfb5c4f6f"
    },
    {
      "unit": "yigdal",
      "language": "en",
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "fragment_index": 0,
      "text": "No other prophet arose in Israel like Moses, who perceived His likeness.",
      "reference_scan": "s43",
      "reference_readings_sha256": "ec12d97226b9adf43efea9e010be1cbf1ac9559095537d959b7760fdfb5c4f6f"
    },
    {
      "unit": "yigdal",
      "language": "en",
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "fragment_index": 0,
      "text": "The true Torah has God given to His people through His prophet, the faithful one of His house.",
      "reference_scan": "s43",
      "reference_readings_sha256": "ec12d97226b9adf43efea9e010be1cbf1ac9559095537d959b7760fdfb5c4f6f"
    },
    {
      "unit": "yigdal",
      "language": "en",
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "fragment_index": 0,
      "text": "God will not alter nor will He change His law for another unto eternity.",
      "reference_scan": "s43",
      "reference_readings_sha256": "ec12d97226b9adf43efea9e010be1cbf1ac9559095537d959b7760fdfb5c4f6f"
    },
    {
      "unit": "yigdal",
      "language": "en",
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "fragment_index": 0,
      "text": "He observes and knows our secrets, perceiving even at its beginning the end of a matter.",
      "reference_scan": "s43",
      "reference_readings_sha256": "ec12d97226b9adf43efea9e010be1cbf1ac9559095537d959b7760fdfb5c4f6f"
    },
    {
      "unit": "yigdal",
      "language": "en",
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "fragment_index": 0,
      "text": "He treats man kindly according to his conduct and sends disaster to the wicked according to his wickedness.",
      "reference_scan": "s43",
      "reference_readings_sha256": "ec12d97226b9adf43efea9e010be1cbf1ac9559095537d959b7760fdfb5c4f6f"
    },
    {
      "unit": "yigdal",
      "language": "en",
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "fragment_index": 0,
      "text": "He will send our Messiah at the end of days to redeem those who wait for the finality of His salvation.",
      "reference_scan": "s43",
      "reference_readings_sha256": "ec12d97226b9adf43efea9e010be1cbf1ac9559095537d959b7760fdfb5c4f6f"
    },
    {
      "unit": "yigdal",
      "language": "en",
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "fragment_index": 0,
      "text": "God will revive the dead in the abundance of His grace. Blessed for ever and ever be His renowned Name.",
      "reference_scan": "s43",
      "reference_readings_sha256": "ec12d97226b9adf43efea9e010be1cbf1ac9559095537d959b7760fdfb5c4f6f"
    }
  ],
